## 2.0 (unreleased)

Breaking changes:
* The emitted code uses the module names introduced by Eliom 13 and
  Ocsigen Start 9: `Eliom.Client.server_function`, `Os.Session`,
  `Os.Current_user`, `Os.Types`. This version therefore requires
  Eliom >= 13 in all modes, and Ocsigen Start >= 9 in the default mode
  (`--rpc-raw` needs only Eliom). Use ocsigen-ppx-rpc 1.x with older
  versions.

New features:
* New `--rpc-internal` flag, used when compiling Ocsigen Start itself:
  the wrappers are emitted with the short module names its modules use
  for each other.

## 1.1

See the git history for changes up to this release.
